<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-27T23:53:32.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:53:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have launched missiles and drones at Saudi targets, striking the Ras Tanura oil refinery, the Saudi Defence Ministry in Riyadh and other strategic sites, while Saudi air defenses have intercepted many of these weapons. A French frigate shot down a missile approaching a Belgian mine hunter in the Red Sea, and Russian satellites have been used to guide Houthi fire at Saudi Arabia. Egypt's parliament has approved military support for Saudi Arabia, and Princess Reema has called for a global campaign to defeat the Iran-backed Houthis. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPMU9tRHdmbzQ2ZHlsQzBDVmpqUEhlTk9meXgzN1VMOWlUMnlKOU1ibFRMQ1VQNDNjTkloUG9lb054S2JXZ2YwMS1MMXM4b1pwczl2clNyTHM5RGZVdnd6bzJXTVl4bW4yZ0pGTEV2aEV4dlR2cDNkc0lvNjVMN2ZScklvRDE3S1VyS0FoaC02Z3BqTHJPeTJrekxhM0dONmN0VzdXTmE5QjNfM0pIZ1Q2SHMtSkZzbFNqSThaN2RybDFBdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPeU0xOG5OOVB3V2d2X0FldE9QZXJHTWpoNG8yYWJfdUdWVVBRaGNyeS0zeGlsdHB3RW9RbVYxdGpWemJGUmFvUGt4R25xeUJGSXllc25MSzdqUFIwdzdjVDZ3TmFRazVDYTN0QlpuOWJxbG5qYnRFU0pzUFRVUzJfZUpEcm9XOWl1NWFKWmNSblhWSXNlS2V0YzhZdHF2b01nWWtNZmNOcG5RWXJ6anBPaUlyVmhTd2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBGLU9IcTdIb3FzeEZTWDBLUEhKZktsRG9sQ25zb0xrQWc1YzhXSG9Pb29MZHRiQjljRHMzc0c4T1U1V2RUTGhWd0ZkVlE5SjdFUk83NlFPVmN1REE4YldfNm95NTNGZHJ2Nl9hSmF1cDQ0clB6cC1PNUVoZHo4Yms?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&